[28.516,"o","Chapter 1. The Beginnings\r\n"]
[28.586,"o","The library was founded in 1864 by a\r\n"]
[28.656,"o","group of teachers and merchants. In the\r\n"]
[28.726,"o","first years the books were kept in a single\r\n"]
[28.796,"o","room, and lending was recorded in a ledger.\r\n"]
[28.866,"o","By the end of the century the collection\r\n"]
[28.936,"o","held over ten thousand volumes, mostly gifts.\r\n"]
